He just moved logic from _menu_option() for EDIT_COPY_NODES and EDIT_PASTE_NODES into their own methods. Seems fine to me. I solved this issue just by doing.

```cpp
graph->connect("copy_nodes_request", callable_mp(this, &VisualScriptEditor::_menu_option), varray(EDIT_COPY_NODES));
graph->connect("paste_nodes_request", callable_mp(this, &VisualScriptEditor::_menu_option), varray(EDIT_PASTE_NODES));
```

But moving it away from menu option and into their own method is probably cleaner. It makes _menu_option easier to read and separates the copy/paste logic into their own methods which I think is a good change.
